 medNote="Acute and preventive doses for paracetamol, indomethacin, prochlorperazine, propranolol, flunarizine and amitriptyline are from the ICMR headache STW; sumatriptan and topiramate doses from US labels; oxygen for cluster headache from NICE CG150. NICE also supports amitriptyline for migraine prevention. Verapamil for cluster prevention is specialist-only. Not clinically reviewed.",
